  "description": "After losing his wife and daughter, Yeo Woonhwi lived for revenge as the Blood Demon, only to die with his vengeance unfulfilled. Given a second chance in the past, he reunites with his family and vows to protect them this time as a Martial God rather than a demon.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70160326/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9A%B0%EB%A6%AC-%EC%95%84%EB%B9%A0%EB%8A%94-%EC%B2%9C%ED%95%98%EC%A0%9C%EC%9D%BC%EC%9D%B8/4948)",
